# Cursor Project Rules

Source of truth: `.ai/` directory.

Read these files before any task:
- `.ai/instructions.md` — global workspace rules
- `.ai/skills/core/architecture.md` — highest priority constraints
- `.ai/skills/core/workflow.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/review.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/testing.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/definition-of-done.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/frontend-javascript.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/frontend-css.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/git.md`
- `.ai/skills/core/documentation.md`

For Joomla tasks, also read:
- `.ai/skills/projects/joomla/joomla.md`
- `.ai/skills/projects/joomla/php.md`
- `.ai/skills/projects/joomla/javascript-leaflet.md`
- `.ai/skills/projects/joomla/joomla-data-json.md`

For Astro tasks, also read:
- `.ai/skills/projects/astro/astro.md`
- `.ai/skills/projects/astro/astro-content.md`
- `.ai/skills/projects/astro/astro-routing.md`

